# CausalQuery::ChangeAttribution / a `unit_change` field: core names the facet shares.
# Preparation also compiles and retains the checked counterfactual, nested
# counterfactual and attribution operations for the Counterfactual,
# NestedCounterfactual, AnomalyAttribution and ChangeAttribution `key` queries;
# a plan for any other query never constructs them.
# Cross-world (nested counterfactual) facade evaluation: drives the counterfactual engine over
