# Reviewed lexical collisions: local validation/cancellation/prepare helpers, crate names,
# query variants and table variables below do not call the isolated numerical providers.
# The participant/report facades call core antecedent_stats adaptive-procedure numerics,
# not the measured adaptive_interval adapter; transported constructor additions are
# export-only design types. Both cases retain their existing numerical facet dependencies.
allow design crates/antecedent/src/analysis/discovered_transport_estimate.rs export
allow mechanism crates/antecedent/src/analysis/contract/result_wire.rs policy_value
allow mechanism crates/antecedent/src/analysis/decision_reliability.rs SelectionRule
allow mechanism crates/antecedent/src/analysis/execute/checked_randomized.rs policy_value
allow mechanism crates/antecedent/src/analysis/learned_trial.rs UncertaintyComponent
